{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund more NHS dental care & prevent dentists from stopping NHS dental care offer",
        "additional_details": "We believe the price of private dental bills is ridiculous and disturbing and as a result many people cannot afford to go private.",
        "background": "We want the Government to fund a greater availability of NHS dental care & prevent dentists who currently offer NHS care from going completely private as many people can\u2019t afford private dental care.",
